  "problem": "The disabled planner had no concrete path to useful, evidence-bound enablement. A compiler could invent datasets, fields, joins or analysis output. Missing required sources could be silently omitted. Adding plan fields could incidentally enable plan_research. Status text could claim an enabled planner prematurely. HTTP 200 or a successful tool envelope could be treated as a completed research task.",
  "resulting_behavior": "No invented dataset, field, join or analysis output can appear; insufficient evidence returns an incomplete plan. The same pinned selections produce the same plan; missing required sources remain a named gap. The eight existing tools continue working if planner activation is not accepted; no status text claims an enabled planner prematurely. Planner activation is not an incidental side effect of adding fields. An accepted plan compiles documented steps; it does not certify a study design. plan_research remains disabled. worker/index.mjs does not import enrichment. HTTP 200 is not a completed research task. Last-good generation live-2026-09-03-85b50522b420 is unchanged.",
